#### Over-imputation (model checking)

Artificially set observed values to missing, re-impute them, and check that the 90%
imputation intervals cover the true observed values at the expected rate (~90%). A
systematic over- or under-coverage pattern reveals model misspecification.

::: {.panel-tabset}

